; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>Transformación Nube</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;">Tasa de Digitalización Zero-WhatsApp (%)</th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>KGI</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;">SIGI Auditoría</th></tr><tr><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>Parque de Activos</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;">Bahías y Transformadores Indisponibles en Proceso</th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>KPI</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;">SCEIN V3.0</th></tr><tr><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>Mantenimiento Red</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;">Tiempo Medio de Reparación de Circuitos (MTTR en Horas)</th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold; padding:5pt 7pt; border:1px solid #003366; text-align:left; font-size:9.5pt;"><strong>KPI</strong></th><th style="background-color:#003366; color:#ffffff; 